#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Dabbler (Freshen Up)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Freshen Up)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Freshen Up, the most common spell in the pre-Cataclysm world.  "
"It saved up a lot of time before work in your old life and you've certainly "
"made a lot of use of it now that there's no more running water."
msgstr ""

