msgid "Dabbler (Aura of Protection)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Aura of Protection)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Aura of Protection.  To be honest, you originally learned it to"
" try to replace the umbrella you kept leaving at home and were very "
"disappointed when that didn't work.  It's saved you at least once from some "
"strange gas in the air, though, so all that effort paid off."
