#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Dabbler (Peaceful Rest)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Peaceful Rest)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
#, c-format
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Peaceful Rest.  Ever since you were a child, you dreaded "
"bedtime.  Falling asleep was an ordeal, a battle between you and the bed, and"
" it seemed like no matter how many sheep you counted, sleep hygiene habits "
"you practiced, or exhausted you felt, it was an hour or more until you "
"finally fell into sleep.  You became a mage because you were tired of having "
"5% of your life stuck staring at the ceiling while waiting for sleep to come,"
" and ever since the world ended, you're even more grateful you can fall "
"asleep whenever you need to."
msgstr ""

