msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Dabbler (Witchsight)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Witchsight)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Witchsight.  People asked you why you would bother learning a "
"spell that only let you know if other people were mages, but every bit of "
"information helped.  A gun you can see, an expensive suit, the size and "
"strength of a person or the way they carry themselves, but a mage's talent is"
" all hidden until they a cast spell.  Unless, of course, you knew how to "
"look, and you did."
msgstr ""

