"In your case, Water's Cooling Touch.  You always hated summer, the "
"stickiness, the heat, the sunburns, and your dislike of the weather drove you"
" to study druidic magic to overcome it.  With your water bottle handy, you'll"
" never have to worry about being too hot in the sun again."
