"In your case, Utility Molding.  You read a pamphlet once entitled, \"One "
"Spell is All You Need!\" and thought it seemed like a good idea.  And true, "
"maybe you've never needed a mining pick before, but the ability to all up a "
"knife or a shovel or a hammer whenever you want has come in handy countless "
