msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (The Turning of the Earth)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, the Turning of the Earth.  Gardening was your passion and you "
"got sick of manually digging rows in early spring or mid-summer weather.  "
"After your studies you could just cast the spell and the earth neatly parted,"
" waiting for seeds to be planted.  Once the canned food runs out, you're sure"
" you'll get even more use of your powers."
msgstr ""

