msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Finger Firelighter.  You had a lot of great conversations with "
"people, late at night outside clubs and restaurants, when they'd ask for a "
"light and you'd just snap your fingers.  Lately, though, you've used it to "
"cook food more than light cigarettes and haven't had anyone to talk to, but "
"at least the fires at night are warm."
msgstr ""

