msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Flames of Passion.  Alcohol is a social lubricant, and if you "
"already had a drink in your hand, why not use it to let you loosen up and "
"make it easier to talk to people?  You were out at parties almost every "
"weekend and had a wide circle of friends.  Hopefully at least a few of them "
"made it through all of this."
msgstr ""

