msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Slowfall.  Some people become mages due to a dream, or a goal "
"they want to pursue, but for you it was the memory of falling down the stairs"
" as a child and breaking your leg.  With your magic you could jump off a roof"
" and it was no more dangerous than jumping off a low stone wall, and that's "
"been pretty useful for some of the situations you've found yourself in since "
"the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""

