msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Faerie Fire.  Maybe it wasn't a great use of your time, but it "
"was fun at parties and one time when your cat ran off it made it very easy to"
" find her.  Since the Cataclysm, though, your magical powers have become much"
" more useful."
msgstr ""

