msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Sorcerer's Hand)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Sorcerer's Hand.  Alright, fine, you admit it, you learned "
"magic because of laziness.  It seems odd to say, with all the hours after "
"work and late at night, studying until you could make your keys twitch and "
"fall off the table and eventually until you can grab a drink from across the "
"room, but it's true.  You could reach nearly everything without having to get"
" up.  Anyway, you're way more active now, and being able to grab things from "
"across the room has come in handy more than once since the end of the world."
msgstr ""

