msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Spider Climb)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Spider Climb.  A lot of people in the rockclimbing community "
"said you were cheating, and, to be honest, they were right.  But every time "
"you saw one of those spectacular views from the summit, well, those "
"complaints didn't mean that much."
msgstr ""

