msgid "Dabbler (Windrunning)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Windrunning)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Windrunning.  It's embarrassing to admit, but you became a mage"
" because you were always running late.  Just one spell made it much easier to"
" catch that bus, to beat that red light across the crosswalk, to make it to "
"work on time instead of a few minutes late.  Nowadays you have a lot more "
"practice at running and that speed still comes in handy."
msgstr ""

