msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Fire Spark.  Most people when they wanted to light a fire "
"thought of kelvinists, but electricity always fascinated you.  You used to "
"love watching the storms roll in, sitting on your porch as the lightning "
"played across the sky, and while summoning lightning bolts wouldn't have been"
" useful for anything at all, catching fires with a spark has come in handy."
msgstr ""

