msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Dabbler (Air Bubble)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were one of the hundreds of millions of people who knew a single spell.  "
"In your case, Air Bubble.  It was originally because of your diving trips.  "
"You were sick of having the goggles and the respirator between you and the "
"sea, and if one simple spell would make it so you didn't have to worry about "
"that again, you were willing to put in the time to learn it.  When you had to"
" swim across that river to escape the horde a while ago, it definitely proved"
" its worth."
msgstr ""

