"In your case, Lamp.  Sure, phones had lights, but they weren't nearly as "
"bright as a magical one was, and it was pretty nice to just recite the words "
"and light up an entire room like a high-powered flashlight.  Now that the "
"power's out, it's even more useful."
msgstr ""

