#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies_fantasy_species.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Lizardfolk (Species)"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Lizardfolk (Species)" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/hobbies_fantasy_species.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are one of the Scaled Ones, called \"lizardfolk\" by the warmbloods.  For"
" generations, your tribe served a dragon as its eyes and ears in the outside "
"world, until civilization encroached far enough that even all the dragon's "
"might could not hold it back.  You were sent out to integrate into the modern"
" world, but you were only there a few years before human science ended their "
"world.  Now, you have to survive in the mess they've created."
msgstr ""

