#. ~ Description of profession "Dimensionalist Mage" for male
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are an expert in dimensionalism, with its most common example being "
"teleportation magic, that is the reason why you could survive while your "
"colleagues could not.  Your only hope is that your highly specialized skills "
"will continue keeping you alive."
msgstr ""

