msgid ""
"Helped by all kind of magical tools and your great talents, you were planning"
" your next great break in.  The world ended before you had time to escape "
"with all of your ill-gained plunder, but at least now nobody can stop you now"
" from breaking whatever locks you desire."
msgstr ""

